        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2830, 7 Inch Modern House Numbers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern House Numbers come packaged with everything you'll need to get the look you want. Each Modern Font Address Number is packaged with the optional stand-offs to float mount them, or they can be flush mounted. Also in the package is the hardware to surface mount or thru-bolt mount the 7 Inch Modern House Numbers. Choose from the most popular modern finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2830-mounting.jpg?v=1704354727\" width=\"600\" height=\"302\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Mounting Options\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Modern Font Address Number\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware for surface and thru-bolt Mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Can be mounted flush or floating.</li>\r\n<li>There are variances in height and width for specific digits. <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2830-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262417\" target=\"new\"><br><b>CLICK HERE to see the specifications of each number (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2830-finishes.jpg?v=1704354727\" width=\"600\" height=\"264\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern House Numbers",
                "description": "The Modern House Numbers come packaged with everything you'll need to get the look you want. Each Modern Font Address Number is packaged with the optional stand-offs to float mount them, or they can be flush mounted. Also in the package is the hardware to surface mount or thru-bolt mount the 7 Inch Modern House Numbers. Choose from the most popular modern finish colors.",
